preConditionHook:
// Level thin air (Brian's notes P1c, triage row P1). The P1 visit scan: a VISIT
// is a bar kk bars ago, minGap <= kk <= lookback, whose low..high range contains
// the current close (inclusive, el_le/el_ge). Thin air = at most maxVisits
// visits (no minVisits floor). Direction from the last momentumLookback-bar
// move: LONG when close > close[momentumLookback], SHORT when below.
visitCount = 0;
for (kk = (int)minGap; kk <= (int)lookback; ++kk) {
    if (el_le(low[kk], close[0]) && el_ge(high[kk], close[0])) visitCount = visitCount + 1;
}
